#. (itstool) path: component/name
#: org.kde.zanshin.metainfo.xml:10
msgid "Zanshin"
msgstr "Zanshin"

#. (itstool) path: component/summary
#: org.kde.zanshin.metainfo.xml:11
msgid "To Do Management Application"
msgstr "Aplikacija za upravljanje zadacima"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.zanshin.metainfo.xml:13
msgid "Zanshin is a powerful yet simple application for managing your day to day actions. It helps you organize and reduce the cognitive pressure of what one has to do in his job and personal life. You'll never forget anything anymore, getting your mind like water."
msgstr "Zanshin je moćna, a jednostavna aplikacija za upravljanje svakodnevnim obvezama. Pomaže vam da ih organizirate i smanjite kognitivno opterećenje koje donose poslovne i osobne obveze. Više nećete ništa zaboraviti i vaš će um biti bistar poput vode."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.zanshin.metainfo.xml:18
msgid "Collect"
msgstr "Prikupi"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.zanshin.metainfo.xml:19
msgid "Worried about forgetting something? Unexpected memory losses? Zanshin is here to help you. You can collect your tasks and free your mind. You will soon stop hearing this voice nagging you about what you probably forgot, or what you should do. Just fire up Zanshin, once something is collected, you are sure to find it there."
msgstr "Brinete li se da ćete nešto zaboraviti? Muče li vas neočekivani gubici pamćenja? Zanshin vam može pomoći. Prikupite svoje zadatke i oslobodite um. Uskoro više nećete čuti unutarnji glas koji vas podsjeća na ono što ste možda zaboravili ili što biste trebali učiniti. Jednostavno pokrenite Zanshin; čim nešto prikupite, ondje ćete to sigurno pronaći."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.zanshin.metainfo.xml:20
msgid "Organize"
msgstr "Organiziraj"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.zanshin.metainfo.xml:21
msgid "Zanshin makes it simple to put your daily life in order. Just create a few projects, a few contexts and start filling them with tasks. You can simply do this using drag and drop. Something has to be done before a given day? Just set a due date and it'll stand out from your other items. You need to work on a project? Focus on it and you will see all the related tasks. Feeling like dealing with your phone calls? Focus on your phone context to find all the pending calls you have to give."
msgstr "Zanshin olakšava organizaciju svakodnevice. Stvorite nekoliko projekata i konteksta pa ih počnite popunjavati zadacima. To možete jednostavno učiniti povlačenjem i ispuštanjem. Trebate li nešto obaviti do određenog dana? Postavite rok i zadatak će se istaknuti među ostalim stavkama. Trebate raditi na projektu? Usredotočite se na njega i prikazat će vam se svi povezani zadaci. Želite li obaviti telefonske pozive? Usredotočite se na telefonski kontekst da biste pronašli sve pozive koje trebate uputiti."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.zanshin.metainfo.xml:22
msgid "Optimize"
msgstr "Optimiziraj"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.zanshin.metainfo.xml:23
msgid "We hackers love our keyboards, and you probably find yourself more efficient with your hands on the keyboard as much as possible. That's why we crafted Zanshin carefully to be completely drivable from the keyboard. We added shortcuts to add tasks, move them to a project or a context, navigate, etc."
msgstr "Mi hakeri volimo tipkovnice, a vjerojatno i vi radite učinkovitije kada ih što više koristite. Zato smo pažljivo osmislili Zanshin tako da se njime u potpunosti može upravljati tipkovnicom. Dodali smo prečace za dodavanje zadataka, njihovo premještanje u projekt ili kontekst, navigaciju i drugo."

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.zanshin.metainfo.xml:24
msgid "Integrate"
msgstr "Integriraj"

#. (itstool) path: description/p
#: org.kde.zanshin.metainfo.xml:25
msgid "Zanshin is an application of the KDE community, as such it unleashes even more power when used with other KDE Applications or within KDE Plasma Desktop. Using KMail? You can create a task right from an email you received and it'll appear in Zanshin's Inbox. Using KOrganizer? All your overdue and coming task will appear in the calendar view. Using Plasma Desktop? Then you can collect from anywhere using KRunner, just type in \"todo: Buy apples\", and you will find that tasks in Zanshin's Inbox, even if it wasn't running!"
msgstr "Zanshin je aplikacija zajednice KDE i pruža još više mogućnosti kada se koristi s drugim KDE-ovim aplikacijama ili u okruženju KDE Plasma. Koristite KMail? Zadatak možete stvoriti izravno iz primljene e-poruke i pojavit će se u ulaznoj pošti Zanshina. Koristite KOrganizer? Svi zadaci kojima je istekao rok i oni koji uskoro dolaze prikazat će se u kalendarskom prikazu. Koristite radnu površinu Plasma? Tada zadatke možete prikupljati bilo gdje pomoću KRunnera: upišite „todo: Buy apples” i zadatak će se pojaviti u ulaznoj pošti Zanshina, čak i ako aplikacija nije pokrenuta!"

